      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "◆怀旧服以下情况无法解本任务：",
      "type": "versioned-gate-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "⑴使用“更换特殊形象”服务功能（800点/7天，3000点/30天）变更为女性外观，无法解本任务。",
      "type": "appearance-restriction",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "⑵使用变身卡（包括【露比限时变身卡】、【露比变身卡】），无法解本任务。",
      "type": "appearance-restriction",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "2.夜晚，前往法兰城（88~93.36~66），寻找护士欧班琦并与之对话，获得【纸条】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
