      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "3.返回法兰城西医院（82.83），与护士长荷洛（16.31）对话，交出【纸条】获得【药？】（【科特林胃肠药】）。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "4.夜晚，前往法兰城（88~93.36~66）与护士欧班琦对话，交出【药？】获得【介绍信】。",
